07.0m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1771515/000177151526000055/0001771515-26-000055-index.htm","accession":"0001771515-26-000055"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.9% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1771515/000177151526000055/0001771515-26-000055-index.htm","accession":"0001771515-26-000055"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 3.6% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1771515/000177151526000055/0001771515-26-000055-index.htm","accession":"0001771515-26-000055"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-15.3% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1771515/000177151526000055/0001771515-26-000055-index.htm","accession":"0001771515-26-000055"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $155.5m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1771515/000177151526000055/0001771515-26-000055-index.htm","accession":"0001771515-26-000055"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.1% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1771515/000214013526000005/0002140135-26-000005-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 22